---
title: Harvest Pork Chop Bake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Meat, Poultry, Fish
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@pork chops{6}
@butter{2%Tbsp}
@cinnamon{1/2%tsp}
@brown sugar{1/4%c}
@apples{3}

Brown pork chops on both sides. Slice apples (don't peel). Grease a glass baking dish and lay sliced apples in dish. Mix together the sugar and cinnamon, then pour over apples. Dot with butter. Lay browned pork chops on top. Cover and bake at 350 degrees until pork chops are done.
